{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/karl-lagerfeld-villas-taraf-meydan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":450,"crm_id":"1648","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Karl Lagerfeld Villas","slug":"karl-lagerfeld-villas-taraf-meydan","display_address":"Meydan","building_type":["villa","branded"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Taraf","price":15000000,"display_price":"15M","lattitude":25.123369,"longitude":55.3190962,"min_bedrooms":5,"max_bedrooms":7,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Introducing The Karl Lagerfeld Villas by Taraf Holding, a remarkable collaboration between fashion icon Karl Lagerfeld and luxury developer Taraf Holding. Located in the prestigious MBR City, Dubai, this exclusive collection features only 51 ultra-luxury villas ranging from <strong>5 to 7 bedrooms</strong>. These residences are more than homes—they are statements of art and fashion, blending sleek minimalism with Parisian elegance. With panoramic views of the Crystal Lagoon and Downtown skyline, each villa boasts design elements like a central catwalk entrance, spiraling staircase, sunken lounge, library, and dedicated Majlis room. Inspired by Lagerfeld’s timeless aesthetic, the interiors reflect a monochromatic palette, textured materials, and haute couture finesse.</p><p>Residents also enjoy access to The Karl Lagerfeld Clubhouse – The Pavilion, a private sanctuary offering luxury lifestyle amenities. From a state-of-the-art spa with hydrotherapy and flotation pods to a fully equipped gym and solar-powered sunbed deck, every element promotes relaxation and rejuvenation. The infinity pool, Parisian-style gardens, and exclusive beauty bar ensure a lifestyle of elegance and indulgence. Situated in the Meydan community, the villas offer seamless connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Meydan Racecourse, Nad Al Sheba, and DXB Airport, setting a new benchmark in designer living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"karl_61759b739c","name":"karl.jpg"},"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"id":12454,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"karl_61759b739c","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"karl.jpg","size":226.67,"width":1770,"height":1000,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_karl_61759b739c","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_karl.jpg","path":null,"size":9.2,"width":245,"height":139}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-06-21T15:42:30.263Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-21T15:42:30.263Z","folderPath":"/","previewUrl":null,"__ggfxIndex":0,"alternativeText":null,"provider_metadata":null},{"id":12454,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"karl_61759b739c","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"karl.jpg","size":226.67,"width":1770,"height":1000,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_karl_61759b739c","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_karl.jpg","path":null,"size":9.2,"width":245,"height":139}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-06-21T15:42:30.263Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-21T15:42:30.263Z","folderPath":"/","previewUrl":null,"__ggfxIndex":1,"alternativeText":null,"provider_metadata":null},{"id":12454,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/karl_61759b739c.jpg","hash":"karl_61759b739c","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"karl.jpg","size":226.67,